              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na chila nyungu mo Jerusalemu na Juda indakala takatifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi, ili osi alavyao sadaka aweze kpwedzahala bazi ya zo nyungu ajitire nyama chizolaviwa sadaka. Siku iyo tamundakala na Mkanani mo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu wa majeshi.",
          "type": "text",
